" href=\"#immersive-outline-6\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-6\">第2–3天【定位】</a></div><ul class=\"immersive-outline-list\" data-branch-for=\"immersive-outline-6\"><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"2\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-7\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-7\">体检</a></div></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"2\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-8\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-8\">定位</a></div></li></ul></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"1\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row is-collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"immersive-outline-caret\" data-caret-for=\"immersive-outline-9\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-label=\"折叠 第4–5天【出内容及拍剪】\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#chevron\"></use></svg></button><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-9\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-9\">第4–5天【出内容及拍剪】</a></div><ul class=\"immersive-outline-list\" data-branch-for=\"immersive-outline-9\"><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"2\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-10\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-10\">选题</a></div></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"2\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-11\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-11\">拍剪</a></div></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"2\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-12\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-12\">运营</a></div></li></ul></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"1\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-13\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-13\">第6–7天【复盘】</a></div></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"1\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-14\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-14\">第2–4周 【进阶】</a></div></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"1\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-15\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-15\">后续【迭代】</a></div></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"1\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link is-active\" href=\"#immersive-outline-16\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-16\">直达底部</a></div></li></ul></nav>\n  </aside>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"immersive-outline-restore\" data-outline-restore=\"\" aria-label=\"展开目录\" aria-expanded=\"false\" hidden=\"\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#chevron\"></use></svg>\n    <span>目录</span>\n  </button>\n  <main class=\"workspace-main\">\n    <header class=\"topbar immersive-standard-topbar\">\n      <div class=\"topbar-left\">\n        <button class=\"mobile-menu\" type=\"button\" data-open-sidebar=\"\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#menu\"></use></svg></button>\n        <div><span>REQUIRED LESSON</span><h1><a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/library.html?section=required\">必修课</a><i>/</i> 课程详情</h1></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"topbar-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"global-search-trigger\" data-open-search=\"\" aria-label=\"打开全站搜索\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#search\"></use></svg><span>搜索</span><kbd>⌘K</kbd></button>\n        <a class=\"back-dashboard\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/library.html?section=required\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#chevron\"></use></svg><span>返回必修课</span></a>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n  <section class=\"immersive-shell\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n    <header class=\"immersive-topbar\">\n      <div>\n        <span>REQUIRED LESSON</span>\n        <h1 data-immersive-title=\"\">【7天行动指南】新人快速完成做IP的0到1</h1>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"immersive-actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"favorite-btn\" id=\"favorite-btn\" data-favorite-btn=\"\"><span data-favorite-text=\"\">⭐️我先关注</span></button>\n        <a class=\"immersive-ghost\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/library.html?section=required\">退出</a>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n    <section class=\"immersive-control-card\">\n      <div class=\"immersive-password\" style=\"display: none;\">\n        <small>访问密码</small>\n        <strong data-immersive-password=\"\">无</strong>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-copy-password=\"\">复制密码</button>\n      </div>\n      <p data-immersive-note=\"\">7天， 你的IP就可以顺利起步</p>\n      <div class=\"immersive-control-actions\" hidden=\"\">\n        <a class=\"content-button\" data-open-original=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"\">打开原链接</a>\n        <button class=\"content-button secondary\" type=\"button\" data-fullscreen=\"\" hidden=\"\">全屏</button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"immersive-viewer\" id=\"immersive-viewer\" hidden=\"\">\n      <iframe title=\"课程录制\" data-immersive-frame=\"\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"fullscreen; encrypted-media; clipboard-write\" hidden=\"\"></iframe>\n      <div class=\"immersive-launch-card\" id=\"immersive-launch\" hidden=\"\">\n        <div class=\"immersive-launch-icon\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#play\"></use></svg></div>\n        <span data-launch-kicker=\"\">腾讯会议录制</span>\n        <h2 data-launch-title=\"\">【7天行动指南】新人快速完成做IP的0到1</h2>\n        <p data-launch-desc=\"\">腾讯会议录制不支持在第三方网页内直接嵌入播放。请先复制访问密码，再打开腾讯会议录制页面观看。</p>\n        <div class=\"immersive-launch-password\" style=\"display: none;\">\n          <small>访问密码</small>\n          <strong data-launch-password=\"\">无</strong>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"immersive-launch-actions\">\n          <button class=\"content-button secondary\" type=\"button\" data-copy-password=\"\" style=\"display: none;\">复制密码</button>\n          <a class=\"content-button\" data-launch-open=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"\">打开腾讯会议录制</a>\n        </div>\n        <em>已为你保留沉浸式页面，只把播放动作交给腾讯会议原页面完成。</em>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"immersive-notes has-collapsed-homework\" id=\"immersive-notes\">\n      <article class=\"immersive-note-card\" data-content-points-card=\"\">\n        <span>CONTENT POINTS</span>\n        <h2>内容要点</h2>\n        <div class=\"immersive-note-body\" data-content-points=\"\"><blockquote><p><strong>【CEO寄语】</strong></p><p><strong>不只是教你使用系统，更是陪你从0到1，真正开始做IP。</strong></p><p>这份手册是AI超级个体联盟实战会员的入门行动地图，帮助你告别盲目摸索，按照清晰的步骤完成IP起步。</p><p>从认识自身优势、明确商业定位，到借助AI完成选题、写稿、拍摄、剪辑、发布、运营和复盘，每一步都有工具支持和操作指引。</p><p><strong>7天完成从定位到发布第一条作品的完整实践，30天逐步建立持续创作的习惯。</strong></p><p>我们不追求无意义的流量，而是帮助你把真实经历、专业能力和商业价值变成内容，让对的人看见你、理解你、信任你，最终实现从内容创作到精准获客的持续成长。</p></blockquote><h2 data-level=\"1\" id=\"immersive-outline-1\">报名</h2><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-2\">报名：点击如下链接报名</h2><blockquote><p>AI超级个体联盟：</p><p><strong>产品页：</strong><a href=\"/products/c-growth.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wxgaochu.com/products/c-growth.html</a>  </p><ul><li>（短网址：<a href=\"https://m.wxgaochu.com/opc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://m.wxgaochu.com/opc</a> ）</li></ul><p><strong>支付页：</strong><a href=\"/payment.html?sku=ai_super_individual_annual\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wxgaochu.com/payment.html?sku=ai_super_individual_annual</a> </p><ul><li>（短网址：<a href=\"https://m.wxgaochu.com/payopc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://m.wxgaochu.com/payopc</a> ）</li></ul></blockquote><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-3\">报名后：</h2><ol><li>确认服务权益和登录手机号（后续使用提交的手机号登陆）</li><li>提交会员入学材料：<a href=\"/member-apply.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wxgaochu.com/member-apply.html</a></li><li>收到运营官提供的激活链接，激活自己的会员专属账号</li></ol><figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_10905b17d48822a8fa1d8698\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_10905b17d48822a8fa1d8698\"></figure><figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_82e7a823704b9541c11f6c6b\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_82e7a823704b9541c11f6c6b\"></figure><h2 data-level=\"1\" id=\"immersive-outline-4\">第0天【入学】</h2><ol><li>提前准备你的自我介绍<ol><li><strong>模板</strong><blockquote><p>简单的自我介绍，让大家更了解我</p><p>【我喜欢大家怎么称呼我】</p><p>【我的坐标常在城市】</p><p>【我的籍贯是哪里】</p><p>【我是做什么工作的】</p><p>【我的兴趣爱好是什么】</p><p>【希望来这里获得哪些收获】</p><p>【我有什么资源能帮到大家】</p></blockquote></li><li><strong>参考</strong><blockquote><p>【我喜欢大家怎么称呼我】</p><p>Peter Wei</p><p>【我的坐标常在城市】</p><p>洛杉矶</p><p>【我的籍贯是哪里】</p><p>辽宁阜新</p><p>【我是做什么工作的】</p><p>金融保险专家系统，人工智能赋能教育</p><p>【我的兴趣爱好是什么】</p><p>爬山、游泳、人工智能演讲与沙龙</p><p>【希望来这里获得哪些收获】</p><p>人工智能应用落地闭环</p><p>【我有什么资源能帮到大家】</p><p>📍人工智能交流、分享与项目评估</p><p>实体部分：</p><p>经营15年以上的业务范围：科技创业项目与商业模式咨询与推广</p></blockquote></li></ol></li><li>每周一入学，参与微信群欢迎仪式</li><li>了解进入会员创作空间的入口：<ol><li>网址页：<a href=\"/login.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wxgaochu.com/login.html</a></li><li>服务号：创作工作台  --》点击<strong>会员中心</strong>   服务号ID：gaochuwenxing </li></ol><figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_9ab3976e72a201fd7a518dde\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_9ab3976e72a201fd7a518dde\"></figure></li></ol><h2 data-level=\"1\" id=\"immersive-outline-5\">第1天【自测】</h2><ol><li>完成会员登录系统后的首个任务【优势测评】<ol><li>自测地址：<a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/founder-role.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wxgaochu.com/member/founder-role.html</a><figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_8f036221eb6a3eba362082b8\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_8f036221eb6a3eba362082b8\"></figure></li></ol></li><li>给自己的现状做个快照<ol><li>自我诊断地址：<a href=\"/assessment/ip-growth.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wxgaochu.com/assessment/ip-growth.html</a><figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_98f77e9b3d1c8ec6408db5b4\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_98f77e9b3d1c8ec6408db5b4\"></figure></li></ol></li></ol><h2 data-level=\"1\" id=\"immersive-outline-6\">第2–3天【定位】  </h2><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-7\">体检</h2><ol><li>填表，看看自己的商业之旅走到哪里了<ol><li>经营体检：<a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/journey.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wxgaochu.com/member/journey.html</a><figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_1a1a46f1e00a1195447d614f\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_1a1a46f1e00a1195447d614f\"></figure><figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_29d2f12214dbe4c652660a00\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_29d2f12214dbe4c652660a00\"></figure></li></ol></li></ol><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-8\">定位</h2><ol><li>提供真实经历与客户问题，完成商业自画像<ol><li>商业定位教练：<a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/portrait.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wxgaochu.com/member/portrait.html</a><figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_ec6be1177565bee80b9a4087\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_ec6be1177565bee80b9a4087\"></figure><figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_c42b25b354d1431c0ebc679b\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_c42b25b354d1431c0ebc679b\"></figure></li></ol></li></ol><h2 data-level=\"1\" id=\"immersive-outline-9\">第4–5天【出内容及拍剪】</h2><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-10\">选题</h2><ol><li><strong>选一个真实客户问题做选题</strong>并改稿<ol><li>选短视频员工：<a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/video-studio.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wxgaochu.com/member/video-studio.html</a><figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_bd278b233e32d640e784f55c\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_bd278b233e32d640e784f55c\"></figure></li><li>说出你的真实经历、观点或者方法：<figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_a010569e7041c8e3db19b7fd\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_a010569e7041c8e3db19b7fd\"></figure></li><li>确定3个选题，输出1条本人愿意说的稿子（不编造经历）<figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_1864eadf55fc2efcf9845fc0\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_1864eadf55fc2efcf9845fc0\"></figure></li></ol></li></ol><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-11\">拍剪</h2><ol><li><strong>拍摄或制作并发布</strong>，完成1条视频作品，并发布作品<ol><li>拍摄员工：<a href=\"https://m.wxgaochu.com/paishe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://m.wxgaochu.com/paishe</a><figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_955d264bedb57d7408d3a870\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_955d264bedb57d7408d3a870\"></figure></li><li>剪辑员工：<a href=\"https://m.wxgaochu.com/jianji\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://m.wxgaochu.com/jianji</a><figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_bba6901e200a5c425ea85c9d\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_bba6901e200a5c425ea85c9d\"></figure></li></ol></li></ol><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-12\">运营</h2><ol><li>按照SOP运营评论区<ol><li>运营员工：<a href=\"https://m.wxgaochu.com/yunying\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://m.wxgaochu.com/yunying</a><figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_74407a591d8c2f91f3d4e290\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_74407a591d8c2f91f3d4e290\"></figure></li></ol></li><li>把作品<strong>转发到会员群里</strong>，寻求反馈</li></ol><h2 data-level=\"1\" id=\"immersive-outline-13\">第6–7天【复盘】</h2><ol><li>记录发布反馈、指出一个需改之处        </li><li>完成1份简短复盘、下一条内容计划<ol><li>复盘员工：<a href=\"https://m.wxgaochu.com/fupan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://m.wxgaochu.com/fupan</a><figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_4bd7f9647f223bd3bbfbe1ef\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_4bd7f9647f223bd3bbfbe1ef\"></figure></li></ol></li></ol><h2 data-level=\"1\" id=\"immersive-outline-14\">第2–4周 【进阶】</h2><ol><li>参加每月2次的入门实操课<ol><li>必修课：<a href=\"https://m.wxgaochu.com/bixiu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://m.wxgaochu.com/bixiu</a></li></ol></li><li>完成内容生产及优化流程，形成可坚持的周节奏</li><li>检查是否更接近业务客户</li><li>进阶课学习：<a href=\"https://m.wxgaochu.com/jinjie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://m.wxgaochu.com/jinjie</a></li></ol><h2 data-level=\"1\" id=\"immersive-outline-15\">后续【迭代】</h2><ol><li>围绕实际业务复盘迭代商业定位</li><li>持续作品与过程记录，逐步观察有效咨询</li><li>根据系统的指引打怪升级<ol><li>我的积分：<a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/points.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wxgaochu.com/member/points.html</a> <figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_e33de7cf417f0dbefcc2ef91\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_e33de7cf417f0dbefcc2ef91\"></figure></li></ol></li><li>参加线上/线下沙龙，持续迭代<ol><li>报名沙龙/邀请朋友参加沙龙：<a href=\"https://m.wxgaochu.com/salon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://m.wxgaochu.com/salon</a></li></ol></li></ol><h2 data-level=\"1\" id=\"immersive-outline-16\">直达底部</h2><p>本页地址：<a href=\"https://m.wxgaochu.com/start\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://m.wxgaochu.com/start</a></p></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"immersive-note-card is-collapsed-h\" data-homework-card=\"\" data-collapse-bound=\"1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n        <span>ACTION</span>\n        <h2>待办或作业</h2>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"immersive-homework-toggle\" aria-controls=\"immersive-homework-body\" aria-label=\"展开待办或作业\" aria-expanded=\"false\">展开</button><div class=\"immersive-note-body\" data-homework-text=\"\" id=\"immersive-homework-body\" hidden=\"\"><p class=\"immersive-note-empty\">暂无待办或作业</p></div>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"course-practice\" data-course-practice=\"\"><span class=\"course-practice-label\">把所学用在自己的业务里</span><h2>学完就试一次</h2><p class=\"course-practice-guide\">写下一件你准备把这节课用到自己业务里的事。</p><form><textarea required=\"\" maxlength=\"1000\" placeholder=\"我准备做的具体动作…\" aria-label=\"课程实践动作\"></textarea><div class=\"course-practice-actions\"><button type=\"submit\" value=\"weekly\">加入本周行动</button><button type=\"submit\" value=\"note\">保存为经营笔记</button></div><p role=\"status\"></p></form></section>\n    <!-- 页面底部数据统计：本页浏览 x 次 · 会员 y 位（放在 immersive-shell 末尾 = 全页最底部） -->\n    <p class=\"page-view-stats\" data-page-view-stats=\"\">本页浏览 112 次 · 会员 20 位</p>\n  </section>\n  </main>\n  <div class=\"workspace-toast\" id=\"workspace-toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n\n\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"sidebar-restore\" data-sidebar-restore=\"\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\" title=\"打开菜单\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#menu\"></use></svg></button><div class=\"nav-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\"></div><div class=\"global-search-dialog\" data-global-search-dialog=\"\" hidden=\"\">\n    <div class=\"global-search-backdrop\" data-close-search=\"\"></div>\n    <section class=\"global-search-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"global-search-title\">\n      <header>\n        <div><span>GLOBAL SEARCH</span><h2 id=\"global-search-title\">全站搜索</h2></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-close-search=\"\" aria-label=\"关闭搜索\">×</button>\n      </header>\n      <label class=\"global-search-field\">\n        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#spark\"></use></svg>\n        <input type=\"search\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"搜索你感兴趣的任何内容吧\" aria-label=\"搜索关键词\">\n        <kbd>ESC</kbd>\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"global-search-status\">输入关键词，快速找到可以继续使用的内容。</div>\n      <div class=\"global-search-results\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n    </section></div><div class=\"global-search-dialog daily-action-dialog\" data-daily-action-dialog=\"\" hidden=\"\">\n    <div class=\"global-search-backdrop\" data-close-daily=\"\"></div>\n    <section class=\"global-search-panel daily-action-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"daily-action-title\">\n      <header>\n        <div><span>DAILY CHECK-IN</span><h2 id=\"daily-action-title\">今日行动 <small class=\"daily-action-brand\">每日出摊</small></h2></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-close-daily=\"\" aria-label=\"关闭今日行动\">×</button>\n      </header>\n      <p class=\"daily-action-hint\">辛苦一天不容易，赶紧记一笔，再小的成果也是进步。</p>\n      <form data-daily-action-form=\"\" class=\"daily-action-form\">\n        <fieldset>\n          <legend>行动类型 <em class=\"required\">必填</em></legend>\n          <div class=\"daily-action-options\">\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_moments\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了条朋友圈</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"xhs_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>写了篇小红书</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_channels_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了视频号</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_oa_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>写了篇公众号</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_oa_card\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发布了公众号贴图</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"short_video\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了短视频</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"long_video\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了长视频</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"qa_answer\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>问答平台答了题</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"client_followup\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>聊了老客户</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"self_media_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>自媒体平台发文</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"deal_closed\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>做了个成交</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"private_pool_growth\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>又加了私域</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"scroll_douyin\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>学习了抖音对标博主</span>\n    </label></div>\n        </fieldset>\n        <label class=\"daily-action-field\">\n          <span>行动标题</span>\n          <input type=\"text\" name=\"title\" maxlength=\"120\" placeholder=\"选填 · 写下今天发出去的内容标题\" data-daily-title=\"\">\n          <small>带标题的记录会展示在 <a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/member-profile.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">你的会员主页</a>，点击可直接跳转查看。</small>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"daily-action-field\">\n          <span>行动网址</span>\n          <input type=\"url\" name=\"url\" maxlength=\"500\" placeholder=\"选填 · 其他会员有权限点击查看\" data-daily-url=\"\">\n          <small>其他会员有权限点击查看。</small>\n        </label>\n        <div class=\"daily-action-actions\">\n 